    '|a||Within a year, how much did productivity rise in the consulted plants, against the others?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:mw6hxg'
    '|a||Here''s what they found.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1360
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||Seventeen percent, within the first year. The consulted plants pulled away from the path they were on.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5840
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|b||Quality defects fell by about half. And none of it was a new machine: they measured defects, logged downtime, cleared old stock off the floor.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8960
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:ais213'
    '|a||Worth an estimated three hundred and twenty-five thousand dollars a year per plant. Then why hadn''t they done it already?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1x03641'
    '|b||Most owners didn''t know the practices existed, or didn''t believe they would pay. And nothing forced them to find out.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6680
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:34juva'
    '|a||Better management lifts a firm. But a country''s productivity also depends on something else: which firms get the workers.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7920
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||To see it, take two bakeries on the mainland, with illustrative numbers. Dockside makes a hundred loaves per baker a day, Seaview fifty. Twenty bakers, ten in each.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1vjo1wi'
    '|a||The town makes seventy-five loaves per baker.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:vl71th'
    '|a||Now move five bakers to Dockside. Neither bakery changed a thing, and the town jumps to eighty-seven and a half.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:14ggcbr'
    '|b||Economists call that reallocation. And they''ve measured how much the real thing is worth.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5160
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow'
    '|b||In American manufacturing, labour productivity is about fifty percent higher than if workers were spread across firms at random.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8960
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:urhhj7'
    '|b||In Western Europe, twenty to thirty. In Eastern Europe at the start of the 1990s, close to nothing; then it grew as markets opened.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8120
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1olq6t6'
    '|a||And competition does the moving. Where buyers can easily switch, as in ready-mixed concrete in busy markets, the weakest plants are squeezed out and the floor rises.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:94vypw'
    '|b||Then why not send all twenty bakers to Dockside? Because a good manager''s time runs out. In the Indian firms, the owners'' own hours capped how far the best could grow.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11160
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:15jq1ez'
    '|a||There''s a neat bit of algebra behind that fifty percent. Show the math, or skip it?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1g2750w'
    '|a||Town productivity is an average of the bakeries, weighted by each one''s share of the bakers.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6040
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||Split it in two: the plain average of the firms, plus a term that is big when the bigger shares sit with the better firms.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:9n4xrc'
    '|a||For the two bakeries: seventy-five, plus twelve and a half from putting three quarters of the bakers at Dockside.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:12cp1bw'
    '|a||That second term is the one measured at fifty percent in America and near zero in early-1990s Eastern Europe.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:a6eppw'
    '|b||But wait. How do we know the top plants really make more? Most data record sales in dollars, not loaves.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6600
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow'
    '|a||Take two more bakeries, with illustrative numbers. Quayside bakes eighty loaves per baker and sells them at two dollars fifty.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:crfpvi'
    '|a||Hilltop, alone on its hill, bakes fifty and charges four dollars.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1jev5o5'
    '|a||In dollars both make two hundred per baker. In loaves, Quayside makes sixty percent more.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1g84uq0'
    '|a||Where researchers counted physical units, in concrete, sugar, even white bread, the gaps were even bigger: efficient plants tend to charge less.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:nwtpp1'
    '|b||But data can mislead the other way too. Correcting for errors in India''s factory records cut the estimated gains from reallocation by about a fifth.':
