      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1v8mia'
    '|b||And the clean causal proof of management is one experiment, with seventeen firms.':
