      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1aaha6u'
    '|a||How sure are we? That firms in the same industry differ hugely, and lastingly: consensus. That management is a real part of it: mostly agreed.':
