      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1c7yhx3'
    '|b||How much of the gap is waste a better economy could fix, and how much is mismeasurement: contested.':
