      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:eii47'
    '|b||Three questions to try it out. A country lets failing state banks keep lending to their oldest clients, however weak. What happens to the gap between its best and worst firms?':
